  "2026-11-11T15:56:23.709Z",codex-agent,"Implementation: both caller templates now distinguish immediate App-created runs from per-new-run GITHUB_TOKEN approval by a maintainer or approval sweep. The automation guide now states REST classic contexts/checks plus every active branch-rules page, the any-nonempty-string presence rule, no caller-CI name matching, and refusal conditions; maintainers must require every intended CI check. Outside-diff fix: accept native freshness only from an active strict required-check ruleset, applicable merge queue, or readable matching classic GraphQL branchProtectionRule with requiresStatusChecks/requiresStrictStatusChecks true and classic enforcement not off. Refuse loose/unreadable freshness with typed notices, no polling. Live public pm-csv read confirmed classic strictness true via GraphQL while REST branch summary omits it. New base-advance contracts inspect real remote refs and retained release content, block a stale successful-check event under strict policy, rebuild on the advanced base, and land only after rebuilt checks pass. New real-fixture cleanup contract injects setup and teardown failures and proves every initialized tracker/server reaches cleanup before errors are reported. Bot plus self-versioned contracts passed 170/170; lint, typecheck and build:test passed. Full publication and decision partitions are running under separate 1200-second caps."
  "2026-11-11T16:08:43.336Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proofs in disposable copies, leaving the source worktree fixed: (1) restoring only enable_auto_merge in both workflows to 2b8375a fails both loose-required-check contracts (2/2) on actual remote base movement after the native passing-check event; (2) removing only the native model freshness refusal fails both strict-base-advance contracts (2/2), demonstrating they inspect remote landing, not merely local checkout state; (3) restoring only releaseDecisionFixtures to serial teardown fails the new real-fixture cleanup regression (1/1) because initialized tracker roots remain when setup failure is reported, with the test finally still cleaning them to avoid hanging; (4) reverting each caller template independently fails its contract (1/1 each); (5) reverting only the automation guide fails its contract (1/1). Restored selection passes 7/7, zero skips/cancellations. Selection: timeout 1200s node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern=\"loose required checks refuse|strict required checks prevent|caller templates|automation guide|decision cleanup\" test/bot-pr-workflow.test.ts test/closeout-workflow-decisions.ts. Outside-diff guard regression uses the loose-check selection; PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM62PU5X uses the strict remote-base selection; PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM62PU5e uses decision cleanup. Full publication 49/49 in 795.031 seconds and decisions 187/187 in 713.877 seconds passed under their 1200-second caps. The existing linked 1140/1200-second deadlines retain measured margin. Final full bot and focused pinned-PM replay are running."
  "2026-11-11T16:10:58.133Z",codex-agent,"Final gate receipt for the 2b8375a review continuation: lint, typecheck and build:test passed. Requested files: bot-pr-workflow 109/109; self-versioned-workflows 61/61 (combined initial run 170/170, then final bot-only run 109/109 after publishing the fixture proposal ref); closeout-workflow-publication 49/49 in 795.031 seconds; closeout-workflow-decisions 187/187 in 713.877 seconds. Total requested-file tests 406/406, no failures/cancellations/skips. The pinned PM focused linked command also passed 7/7 in a disposable tracker with --run --progress and schema/source context (8.921 seconds, exit 0), keeping run artifacts out of the package tracker. Every gate had an explicit cap no longer than 1200 seconds. Revert receipts above identify the exact function/file mutations and observed behavioral assertions; restored focused selection passes 7/7. Thread mapping: PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM62PU5Q caller templates; PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM62PU5I exact discovery documentation; PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM62PU5X remote base/proposal freshness and scheduled rebuild; PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM62PU5e all-initialized-fixture cleanup. Outside-diff PRR_kwDOTbN4pM8AAAABXVuP0Q is fixed by the shared strict-check/merge-queue guard, typed refusal and real remote stale-landing regression. Full coverage/release gates remain CI-owned at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/pull/229/checks. No review replies, resolutions or reactions posted. Releasing the claim without closing, then regenerating the changelog and pushing this scoped round."
